It is Thursday.
It is half past seven in the evening.
I walk into the hair salon.
I have a new appointment.
The hairdresser greets me warmly.
"Good evening, Frau Flores," he says.
I take off my jacket.
Then I sit down on the chair.
The hairdresser washes my hair.
"I always wear my hair short," I say.
"Short hair is very practical," he answers.
He cuts my hair.
The hairdresser works very fast.
The new haircut is soon finished.
I look in the mirror.
I love the new style!
I say thank you and go outside.
I walk happily to my flat.
Tomorrow is Friday.
I am ready for the weekend!
